            <div xml:id="d578">

                <pb facs="0863" n="847" sameAs="frus:frus1947v04/pg847"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>On November 1, the Yugoslav Government ordered the expulsion from the country
                    within 24 hours of Mr. and Mrs. Arthur Brandel, the resident correspondents of
                    the <hi rendition="#italic">New York Times</hi> and the United <pb facs="0864"
                        n="848" xml:id="pg848"/> Press, respectively. Ambassador Cannon discussed
                    the case with Acting Foreign Minister Velebit the same day, and on November 2,
                    Ambassador Cannon presented to the Acting Foreign Minister a note requesting
                    that the expulsion be reconsidered. For the text of the note see Department of
                    State <hi rendition="#italic">Bulletin</hi>, November 16, 1947, page 961.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
